#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/troubleshooting.rst:24
msgid ""
"Layouts 1.3 and 2.0 do not use Pacemaker or ``pcs`` commands. Use the "
"commands below for these layouts. Legacy clusters use the Pacemaker "
"diagnostics in :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/mvm`."
